  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 29 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">A beach is the default honeymoon. For a couple who both love the mountains, there is something far more memorable: being flown onto an empty Arctic peak to ski untracked snow together, then returning to a four-star fjord lodge as the long spring sun lingers over the water. A heli-ski honeymoon in Iceland is dramatic, intimate and genuinely once-in-a-lifetime. This guide covers why it works, when to go and how to plan it, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
